 * references list and community "hair stories", not a petition-signature
 * counter. Standalone page reusing design-system primitives.
 *
 * IMPORTANT: the sign-up form's action URL, field names, and submit
 * handler are preserved byte-for-byte from the original — per CLAUDE.md,
 * "Don't touch the donation/payment integration logic, petition
 * submission logic, or form handlers." Only the visual wrapper changed.
 * Real content preserved verbatim — see .bak-pre-step2 for the original.
 */
