---
<Layout
  headHtml=""
  title="Sign the Open Letter to L'Oréal | #NoMoreLyes | Level Up"
  description="Add your name to the open letter calling on L'Oréal to make hair relaxers safe or remove them from shelves. Signed by MPs, campaigners and 5,000+ supporters."
>
  <Header heroBg="loud-lilac" />

  <Section bg="loud-lilac">
    <a href="/active-campaigns/nomorelyes-2" class="nol-back">&larr; Back to #NoMoreLyes</a>
    <Label color="electric-yellow">#NoMoreLyes</Label>
    <Headline color="off-white">Open letter to L'Oréal</Headline>
    <p style="color: var(--color-off-white); max-width: 46ch;">Are your hair relaxers putting Black women's health at risk?</p>
    <Button bg="electric-yellow" text="navy" href="#sign" label="Sign the open letter" />
  </Section>

  <Section bg="off-white">
    <div class="nol-prose">
      <p>In 2021, Oxford University published damning research that found a link between long-term use of hair relaxers containing lye and a <strong>30% increased risk of breast cancer</strong> for Black women. L'Oréal is one of the biggest manufacturers of lye-based hair relaxers, marketed specifically at Black women.</p>
      <p>In August 2021, Level Up and more than 5,000 petition signers asked L'Oréal to remove cancerous chemicals from these products. <strong>To date, they have still not responded.</strong></p>
      <p>Further studies have since linked frequent, long-term use of hair relaxers to <strong>more than double the risk of developing uterine cancer</strong> for Black women. Thousands of lawsuits have been filed against L'Oréal over the last decade — from scalp burns and permanent hair loss, to fibroids and uterine cancer.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="electric-yellow">
    <div class="nol-stats">
      {STATS.map((s) => (
        <div class="nol-stat">
          <span class="nol-stat-value">{s.value}</span>
          <span class="nol-stat-caption">{s.caption}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="off-white">
    <Label color="navy">The open letter</Label>
    <Headline as="h2">To: Nicolas Hieronimus, CEO of L'Oréal Group and Jean Paul Agon, Chairman of L'Oréal Group</Headline>
    <div class="nol-prose">
      <p>Black women should be able to trust that the products we use won't hurt us, but Level Up's 2022 survey found that <strong>95% of Black British women don't trust beauty brands that sell lye-based relaxers.</strong> This should come as no surprise since L'Oréal's hair relaxers continue to be sold — including those intended for children — labelled as "no-lye" whilst listing sodium hydroxide (lye) in the ingredients. How can we make informed decisions about products without transparency from manufacturers?</p>
      <p>Now is the time for L'Oréal to lead the way in the beauty industry by taking responsibility for the harms caused by your products. We know that Black women's money matters to you, so we're calling on L'Oréal to demonstrate that Black women matter too.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="navy">
    <Label color="electric-yellow">Our three demands</Label>
    <Headline as="h2" color="off-white">Take action now to ensure:</Headline>
    <div class="nol-demands">
      {DEMANDS.map((d) => (
        <div class="nol-demand">
          <span class="nol-demand-num">{d.num}</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="nol-demand-title">{d.title}</h3>
            <p class="nol-demand-desc">{d.description}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="pale-yellow">
    <blockquote class="nol-pullquote">The price of beauty should never be our health.</blockquote>
    <p class="nol-prose" style="max-width: 60ch;">We know you have a commitment to being "number one in the world" regarding ethics — but the harm caused to Black women by frequent and long-term use of chemical straighteners doesn't align with that. Black women already spend up to nine times more than any other group on hair care. We shouldn't be paying with our health too.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="off-white">
    <div id="sign" class="nol-sign-grid">
      <div class="nol-sign-left">
        <Headline as="h2">Add your name</Headline>
        <p>Over 5,000 people have already signed. Add your voice to the open letter demanding L'Oréal make hair relaxers safe — or remove them.</p>
        <div class="nol-recent-signers">
          <p class="nol-recent-label">Recent signers</p>
          <ul class="nol-recent-list">
            {RECENT_SIGNERS.map((s) => (
              <li><span class="nol-recent-name">{s.name}</span><span class="nol-recent-loc">{s.loc}</span></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
          <p class="nol-recent-more">+ 5,000 others across the UK</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nol-sign-right">
        <form id="ol-sign-form" class="nol-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xdayzrlz" method="POST">
          <div class="nol-form-row">
            <div class="nol-form-field">
              <label class="nol-form-label" for="ol-first-name">First name</label>
              <input id="ol-first-name" class="nol-form-input" type="text" name="first_name" placeholder="Your first name" required />
            </div>
            <div class="nol-form-field">
              <label class="nol-form-label" for="ol-last-name">Last name</label>
              <input id="ol-last-name" class="nol-form-input" type="text" name="last_name" placeholder="Your last name" required />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="nol-form-field">
            <label class="nol-form-label" for="ol-email">Email address</label>
            <input id="ol-email" class="nol-form-input" type="email" name="email" placeholder="hello@example.com" required />
          </div>
          <div class="nol-form-field">
            <label class="nol-form-label" for="ol-postcode">Postcode</label>
            <input id="ol-postcode" class="nol-form-input" type="text" name="postcode" placeholder="e.g. E1 6RF" />
          </div>
          <div class="nol-form-check">
            <input type="checkbox" id="ol-updates" name="keep_me_updated" class="nol-check-input" />
            <label for="ol-updates" class="nol-check-label">Keep me updated on this campaign and Level Up news</label>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="nol-form-submit">
            Sign the open letter <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </button>
          <p class="nol-form-note">Your details are stored securely. We will never share your personal data with third parties.</p>
        </form>
        <div id="ol-success" class="nol-success" style="display:none;">
          <div class="nol-success-icon">✓</div>
          <h3>Thank you for signing!</h3>
          <p>Your name has been added to the open letter to L'Oréal. Together we're demanding they make hair relaxers safe for Black women.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="pale-yellow">
    <Label color="navy">This letter is signed by</Label>
    <Headline as="h2">Signatories</Headline>
    <div class="nol-sig-notable">
      {NOTABLE_SIGNATORIES.map((s) => (
        <div class="nol-sig-org">
          <span class="nol-sig-name">{s.name}</span>
          {s.role && <span class="nol-sig-role">{s.role}</span>}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="nol-sig-inline-group">
      <p class="nol-sig-section-label">MPs</p>
      <p class="nol-sig-names-inline">{MPS}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="nol-sig-inline-group">
      <p class="nol-sig-section-label">And more than 5,000 individual signatories including:</p>
      <p class="nol-sig-names-inline">{INDIVIDUAL_SIGNATORIES}</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="off-white">
    <Label color="navy">Sources</Label>
    <Headline as="h2">References</Headline>
    <ol class="nol-refs-list">
      {REFERENCES.map((r) => <li><a href={r.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{r.text}</a></li>)}
    </ol>
  </Section>

  <Section bg="off-white">
    <Label color="navy">Community voices</Label>
    <Headline as="h2">Hair stories</Headline>
    <p class="nol-hs-intro">Black women across the UK have shared what using hair relaxers has meant for their lives and health.</p>
    <div class="nol-hs-grid">
      {HAIR_STORIES.map((h) => (
        <div class="nol-hs-card">
          <p class="nol-hs-quote">"{h.quote}"</p>
          <div class="nol-hs-meta">
            <span class="nol-hs-name">{h.name}</span>
            {h.loc && <span class="nol-hs-loc">{h.loc}</span>}
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <a href="/memory/hair-stories" class="nol-hs-link">Read all hair stories →</a>
  </Section>

  <Footer bg="loud-lilac" />
</Layout>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('ol-sign-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const success = document.getElementById('ol-success');
  if (form) {
    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const data = new FormData(form);
      try {
        const res = await fetch(form.action, {
          method: 'POST',
          body: data,
          headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
        });
        if (res.ok) {
          form.style.display = 'none';
          if (success) success.style.display = 'block';
        } else {
          const btn = form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.nol-form-submit');
          if (btn) btn.textContent = 'Something went wrong — please try again';
        }
      } catch {
        const btn = form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.nol-form-submit');
        if (btn) btn.textContent = 'Something went wrong — please try again';
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
